teach_text = "If two people contradict each other, then at least one of them lies."
bottom_out_text = "B1 and A3 say completely opposite statements, so they must have opposite roles. C2 and C3 clear each other, so they have the same role. They cannot both lie, so they are innocent. A2 has to tell the truth otherwise it would create a contradiction, so the liar in this row is inevitably B2. We know the other liar has to be B1 or A3, so everyone else is innocent, especially B3, who implies that B1 is the second liar."

